						"type": "text",
						"props": {
							"markdown": "## Computation slots of parameter controls\n\nThe slots sit on the parameter control, next to `type` and `props`, and run only when that parameter was part of the computation.\n\n- **Length**: `computationstart` shows *Length started*, `computationend` shows *Length computed*.\n- **Hide Door** (accept/reject, inline): `computationend` shows *Door computed* when the change is accepted, not when it is queued.\n- **Material Color**: no slots.\n- **Root**: `computationend` shows *Root computed* for every computation.\n- **Change both** sets Length and Hide Door in one computation, so both controls run their slots.\n\nChange **Material Color** to see that only the root slot runs."
						}
					}
				]
